import tests/games/geometry_dash/application.dl

set session to a new route session
set interface to an instance of geometry dash with state (the address of session)
bind (the control labeled "Run" in (the address of interface)) in (the address of interface) to (the function named "paint the route on $") for event 1
set view to a native view of (the address of interface) sized 1280 by 780 using fonts "tests/games/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "tests/games/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf"
set view's theme's accent to UI ink 182 255 58
refresh the route in (the address of interface)
explore routes using the address of view
close the address of view
close the address of interface
close the address of session
